{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-tsx","path":"/blog/2023-04-02--cposc-2023/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"disqus":"edward-j-schwartz"}},"post":{"html":"<p>My family and I had quite the day attending the <a href=\"https://www.cposc.org\">2023 Central Pennsylvania Open\nSource Conference (CPOSC)</a> yesterday at the Ware Center\nin Lancaster, PA.  In addition to attending, we spoke in three different talks!</p>\n<p>My wife, Dr. Stephanie Schwartz, kicked things off.  <figure class=\"gatsby-resp-image-figure\" style=\"\">\n    <span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/5e403f4ebefe3b13be78183c9d16f8f1/f13a9/steph.avif 200w,\n/static/5e403f4ebefe3b13be78183c9d16f8f1/af71e/steph.avif 400w,\n/static/5e403f4ebefe3b13be78183c9d16f8f1/c9875/steph.avif 800w,\n/static/5e403f4ebefe3b13be78183c9d16f8f1/07e28/steph.avif 1200w,\n/static/5e403f4ebefe3b13be78183c9d16f8f1/2babf/steph.avif 1600w,\n/static/5e403f4ebefe3b13be78183c9d16f8f1/95b77/steph.avif 2048w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n              type=\"image/avif\"\n            /><source\n              srcset=\"/static/5e403f4ebefe3b13be78183c9d16f8f1/ba381/steph.webp 200w,\n/static/5e403f4ebefe3b13be78183c9d16f8f1/7f61c/steph.webp 400w,\n/static/5e403f4ebefe3b13be78183c9d16f8f1/d00b9/steph.webp 800w,\n/static/5e403f4ebefe3b13be78183c9d16f8f1/92f8c/steph.webp 1200w,\n/static/5e403f4ebefe3b13be78183c9d16f8f1/fad48/steph.webp 1600w,\n/static/5e403f4ebefe3b13be78183c9d16f8f1/8df42/steph.webp 2048w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/5e403f4ebefe3b13be78183c9d16f8f1/e07e9/steph.jpg 200w,\n/static/5e403f4ebefe3b13be78183c9d16f8f1/066f9/steph.jpg 400w,\n/static/5e403f4ebefe3b13be78183c9d16f8f1/4b190/steph.jpg 800w,\n/static/5e403f4ebefe3b13be78183c9d16f8f1/e5166/steph.jpg 1200w,\n/static/5e403f4ebefe3b13be78183c9d16f8f1/b17f8/steph.jpg 1600w,\n/static/5e403f4ebefe3b13be78183c9d16f8f1/e1596/steph.jpg 2048w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n            type=\"image/jpeg\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/5e403f4ebefe3b13be78183c9d16f8f1/4b190/steph.jpg\"\n            alt=\"Stephanie\npresenting\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class=\"gatsby-resp-image-figcaption\">Stephanie\npresenting</figcaption>\n  </figure>  She gave a short introduction on Random Forests as an\nintroduction for her student Samantha Noggle, in \"Machine Learning Techniques to\nImprove Users' Music Listening Experiences\".  I thought Samantha did a great job\non her presentation.  It was an interesting topic that she presented at just the\nright level of detail.</p>\n<p>Next, my step son Nick Elzer, along with his coworker from\n<a href=\"https://www.quub.space\">Quub</a>, Nathaniel Every, gave his first ever public\nconference presentation, and did a great job!  <figure class=\"gatsby-resp-image-figure\" style=\"\">\n    <span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/dfdfd2ba33babbf1d62c4d7acd43c816/f13a9/nick.avif 200w,\n/static/dfdfd2ba33babbf1d62c4d7acd43c816/af71e/nick.avif 400w,\n/static/dfdfd2ba33babbf1d62c4d7acd43c816/c9875/nick.avif 800w,\n/static/dfdfd2ba33babbf1d62c4d7acd43c816/07e28/nick.avif 1200w,\n/static/dfdfd2ba33babbf1d62c4d7acd43c816/2babf/nick.avif 1600w,\n/static/dfdfd2ba33babbf1d62c4d7acd43c816/95b77/nick.avif 2048w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n              type=\"image/avif\"\n            /><source\n              srcset=\"/static/dfdfd2ba33babbf1d62c4d7acd43c816/ba381/nick.webp 200w,\n/static/dfdfd2ba33babbf1d62c4d7acd43c816/7f61c/nick.webp 400w,\n/static/dfdfd2ba33babbf1d62c4d7acd43c816/d00b9/nick.webp 800w,\n/static/dfdfd2ba33babbf1d62c4d7acd43c816/92f8c/nick.webp 1200w,\n/static/dfdfd2ba33babbf1d62c4d7acd43c816/fad48/nick.webp 1600w,\n/static/dfdfd2ba33babbf1d62c4d7acd43c816/8df42/nick.webp 2048w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/dfdfd2ba33babbf1d62c4d7acd43c816/e07e9/nick.jpg 200w,\n/static/dfdfd2ba33babbf1d62c4d7acd43c816/066f9/nick.jpg 400w,\n/static/dfdfd2ba33babbf1d62c4d7acd43c816/4b190/nick.jpg 800w,\n/static/dfdfd2ba33babbf1d62c4d7acd43c816/e5166/nick.jpg 1200w,\n/static/dfdfd2ba33babbf1d62c4d7acd43c816/b17f8/nick.jpg 1600w,\n/static/dfdfd2ba33babbf1d62c4d7acd43c816/e1596/nick.jpg 2048w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n            type=\"image/jpeg\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/dfdfd2ba33babbf1d62c4d7acd43c816/4b190/nick.jpg\"\n            alt=\"Nick and Nathaniel\npresenting\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class=\"gatsby-resp-image-figcaption\">Nick and Nathaniel\npresenting</figcaption>\n  </figure>  Their presentation was \"SpaceHeX Beta1.0 Release - What\nIf, For Space Hardware Development, We Put Each Egg In Its Own Basket?\", and was\nabout SpaceHex, a prototyping system they open sourced to make it easier for\npeople to break into satellite development.  They also demoed a pretty sweet\nomnidirectional rover that they built (at 2am the night before, naturally).</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Started the open source repo for our space hardware development platform <a href=\"https://t.co/cRzHZkM6Gg\">https://t.co/cRzHZkM6Gg</a><br><br>Had a blast presenting with <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Nick_elzer?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">@Nick_elzer</a> for <a href=\"https://twitter.com/quubspace?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">@quubspace</a>!<br><br>Thank you <a href=\"https://twitter.com/CPOSC?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">@CPOSC</a> for having us! <a href=\"https://t.co/eRoHm5ea2u\">pic.twitter.com/eRoHm5ea2u</a></p>&mdash; Nathaniel Evry (@NathanielEvry) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/NathanielEvry/status/1642204542921064452?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">April 1, 2023</a></blockquote> <script async src=\"https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"></script>\n<p>Finally, I gave a tutorial presentation called \"Introduction to Exploiting Stack\nBuffer Overflow Vulnerabilities\".  If you want, you can follow along\n<a href=\"https://github.com/edmcman/cposc-exploit\">here</a>. <figure class=\"gatsby-resp-image-figure\" style=\"\">\n    <span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/f13a9/ed.avif 200w,\n/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/af71e/ed.avif 400w,\n/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/c9875/ed.avif 800w,\n/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/07e28/ed.avif 1200w,\n/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/2babf/ed.avif 1600w,\n/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/95b77/ed.avif 2048w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n              type=\"image/avif\"\n            /><source\n              srcset=\"/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/ba381/ed.webp 200w,\n/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/7f61c/ed.webp 400w,\n/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/d00b9/ed.webp 800w,\n/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/92f8c/ed.webp 1200w,\n/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/fad48/ed.webp 1600w,\n/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/8df42/ed.webp 2048w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/e07e9/ed.jpg 200w,\n/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/066f9/ed.jpg 400w,\n/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/4b190/ed.jpg 800w,\n/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/e5166/ed.jpg 1200w,\n/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/b17f8/ed.jpg 1600w,\n/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/e1596/ed.jpg 2048w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n            type=\"image/jpeg\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/4b190/ed.jpg\"\n            alt=\"Me speaking\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption class=\"gatsby-resp-image-figcaption\">Me speaking</figcaption>\n  </figure>  In\ntheory, there are supposed to be videos of all three talks eventually.  I'll\npost them when they are made available.</p>\n<p>After a few years of hiatus, it was great to have CPOSC 2023 be back in person\nagain.  I saw a number of great presentations, and met a lot of interesting and\nsmart people.  It's always surprising how many technical people work in an area\nthat is known for its rural farming!</p>","excerpt":"My family and I had quite the day attending the 2023 Central Pennsylvania Open\nSource Conference (CPOSC) yesterday at the Ware Center\nin…","timeToRead":1,"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2023-04-02--cposc-2023/"},"frontmatter":{"tags":["talks"],"author":{"jsonId":"Edward J. Schwartz","bio":"Computer Security Researcher","twitter":"@edmcman","avatar":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"fixed","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/b0e73023d6a6055546d8e671edd67950/4ed6d/ed.png","srcSet":"/static/b0e73023d6a6055546d8e671edd67950/4ed6d/ed.png 80w","sizes":"80px"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/b0e73023d6a6055546d8e671edd67950/1deab/ed.webp 80w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"80px"}]},"width":80,"height":80}}}},"title":"CPOSC 2023","updatedDate":"Apr 2, 2023","image":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"fixed","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/d5441/ed.jpg","srcSet":"/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/d5441/ed.jpg 700w,\n/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/284f1/ed.jpg 1400w","sizes":"700px"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/efd8f/ed.webp 700w,\n/static/11b699d88952ee57fbe4ffd5207d7451/93de6/ed.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","siz